# License gate — append these lines at the END of .github/CODEOWNERS.
#
# Order matters: GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so a catch-all such
# as `* @in2workspace/kizunaops` placed after these lines would silently cancel
# them. Since ES-06 was dropped along with the shared evaluator, CODEOWNERS is
# the only control preventing a pull request from widening the policy at the
# same time as it introduces the dependency the policy would have blocked.
/.github/license-policy.json        @in2workspace/devops-lead
/.github/license-exceptions.json    @in2workspace/devops-lead
/.github/scripts/license-gate.mjs   @in2workspace/devops-lead
/.github/workflows/license-gate.yml @in2workspace/devops-lead
